* kT/C Noise — Time-Domain Statistical Measurement
* Noisy switch Ron = {R_val} ohm, Csamp = {C_val}
* Thermal noise modeled via trnoise voltage source in series with R
* Expected sigma = sqrt(kT/C) = {sigma_uv} uVrms

Vin in 0 DC {Vdc}

* Thermal noise source (Thevenin model of switch Ron noise)
Vn in nr DC 0 trnoise({nt} {nt_dt} 0 0)

* Switch-equivalent resistance (noiseless — noise comes from Vn)
R1 nr out {R_val}

* Sampling capacitor
C1 out 0 {C_val}

.control
tran {tstep} {tstop} UIC
wrdata {wrdata_path} v(out)
.endc

